{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-03T01:04:59.139Z","author":"pi-ollama","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"fffd5142cf13337359aa8b1f","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-03T01:04:59.139Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-03T01:04:59.139Z","author":"pi-ollama","text":"Fix plan: (1) normalize zero-padded tag candidates and the deprecated pm-github-version input in both reusable workflows' resolve steps with pure bash (10# arithmetic on pre-validated numeric components, -N suffix preserved), before the ambiguity check and the legacy-input comparison; (2) export normalizeReleaseVersion from scripts/daily-release-plan.ts and route npm_version through it; (3) add self-versioned-workflows rows for padded tag, padded tag with suffix, padded legacy input, padded tag matching a normalized input without warning, and two tags normalizing to one version not being ambiguous, plus a revert proof and a table test asserting the workflow resolution equals the plan's npm_version for tags like v2026.11.02, v2026.09.01, v2026.10.19, v2027.01.01-2; (4) regenerate the changelog. Existing refusals and the strict N.N.N(--N)? validation stay untouched."}]}],"before_hash":"37f93bd33123f82c71654e6a93c1345482707bb1540810457b91e4c05f1fb99b","after_hash":"6c1db0475cfd7b9d99731b7e9a5a267ff9117a46de740432080ac6399c075485","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"a2112fe5a29be59e3e6ed641a1fef41e29622a7b90e706eedbc08cba8a7eea30"}
