{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-03T01:33:37.993Z","author":"pi-ollama","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"fffd5142cf13337359aa8b1f","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"tests_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tests/4","value":{"command":"node --test test/closeout-workflow.test.ts","scope":"project","provenance":{"author":"pi-ollama","created_at":"2026-11-03T01:33:37.927Z","source_kind":"local_mutation","source_ref":"fix/normalize-release-tag-version"}}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-03T01:33:37.993Z"}],"before_hash":"7120d2e325d20cace9aa43389b677ec296e178177369fabd732bf8515894b80f","after_hash":"76c3fbec3076cea4770ffc27745e063bb45f1625848d86bacc73763ceeea462f","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"maintenance","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"8ebf499a875fa85f729bf6b90d8b3573868024ca67262888b5bb7f5ea25211ba"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-03T01:36:26.093Z","author":"pi-ollama","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"fffd5142cf13337359aa8b1f","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-03T01:36:26.093Z","author":"pi-ollama","text":"Implemented. Both reusable workflows now strip zero padding from each numeric component of the tag candidate (before the ambiguity check) and of the deprecated pm-github-version input (after validating it as N.N.N/N.N.N-N, so arithmetic never evaluates untrusted text; an unparseable input stays raw and can only warn). A -N suffix is preserved, the strict validation and every existing refusal remain, and both resolve steps stay byte-identical. scripts/daily-release-plan.ts now exports normalizeReleaseVersion and routes npm_version and the released-version comparison through it, so the tag-to-npm-version rule is shared with the workflows. New self-versioned-workflows rows cover a padded tag (v2026.11.02 -> 2026.11.2), a padded tag with suffix (v2027.01.01-2 -> 2027.1.1-2), a padded legacy input, a padded tag matching a normalized input without warning, and two tags on one commit normalizing to the same version not being ambiguous; a revert test removes the normalization call and shows the padded tag then resolves to 2026.11.02, failing the row; a table test asserts the workflow resolution equals decideDailyRelease().npm_version for tags the plan emits from 2026.11.02, 2026.09.01, 2026.10.19 and 2027.01.01-2. The Unreleased changelog section gained the docs note through the normal changelog regeneration after fetching tags."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-03T01:36:26.093Z"}],"before_hash":"76c3fbec3076cea4770ffc27745e063bb45f1625848d86bacc73763ceeea462f","after_hash":"ef5a5abaac621937b5df11c7be8a4930556f350b5164fd26c25318ff7d02781d","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"17ac336b6d3b8b874e4983e7ccf744afb54c13932af4db18ee2a96538e3a0895"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-03T01:36:28.378Z","author":"pi-ollama","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"fffd5142cf13337359aa8b1f","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-03T01:36:28.375Z","author":"pi-ollama","text":"Gate results: node --test test/self-versioned-workflows.test.ts -> 55/55 pass; node --test test/daily-release-plan.test.ts -> 23/23 pass; node --test test/release-workflow.test.ts -> 9/9 pass; npm run typecheck -> pass; npm run lint -> pass. node --test test/closeout-workflow.test.ts fails locally, but identically on pristine main at the branch point (same assertions on the first 27 failures, suite also exceeds local timeouts), while upstream CI on that same main commit is green, so it is a pre-existing shared-host environment issue and not a regression of this change; recorded as follow-up item pm-github-gaq8. release:check and the coverage gate were not run locally per the shared-host memory constraint."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-03T01:36:28.378Z"}],"before_hash":"ef5a5abaac621937b5df11c7be8a4930556f350b5164fd26c25318ff7d02781d","after_hash":"4dc723021df6a71af75bcb4b0b607c00af7a6d7ab2c502602a9b1b99563f3424","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"7b186d30aa058dd399cba1d20247d117673afc2130512c4a8051624fd27e3ddd"}
